   "html": "<p><strong>Happier Than Ever: The Destination</strong> came to life over 3 days at a gorgeous mansion on a private 8-acre estate. Guests were invited to step into Billie’s world — an elegant experience modeled after a dreamy cinematic getaway and soundtracked by the new album. A series of unforgettable moments brought the music to life while inviting fans to discover the three Spotify Enhanced Albums within. A VIP preview party on Thursday celebrated the official release of the album and kicked off the weekend of fan exploration on Friday and Saturday.</p>\n<p>Staged at the height of the pandemic, the event was a critical tentpole for both the launch of Billie’s latest release and Spotify’s newest promotion. Despite the state of the world, the experience was a massive success with fan and influencer sentiment extremely high with some even breaking down in tears.</p>\n<p>The Destination was a hit for press as well with 24 separate articles including coverage in <a href=\"https://variety.com/2021/music/news/billie-eilish-happier-than-ever-spotify-release-party-1235031529/\"><strong>Variety</strong></a>, <a href=\"https://people.com/music/billie-eilish-celebrates-happier-than-ever-spotify-release-with-family/\"><strong>People</strong></a>, <a href=\"https://www.bustle.com/entertainment/billie-eilish-happier-than-ever-launch-party-photos\"><strong>Bustle</strong></a> and <a href=\"https://www.dailymail.co.uk/tvshowbiz/article-9843597/Billie-Eilish-releases-second-album-Happier-Ever.html\"><strong>The Daily Mail</strong></a>. The activation also <strong>won the Silver Reggie Award for Experiential Marketing (Live Events and Installations)</strong>.</p>"
  }
 ],
