  {
   "title": "VIP ALBUM RELEASE PARTY",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>Industry and press were invited to explore a first-look at the experience over complimentary drinks, food and live music from DJ Nala. <strong>Hosted by Billie Eilish and Finneas, the estate was lit up special for this exclusive night time event. At 9pm, the audience was treated to a debut listen of the album itself with Billie giving a speech and then immediately diving into the pool with her friends fully clothed before also singing Finneas Happy Birthday.</strong></p>",
     "right": "<p>Notable guests included Olivia Rodrigo, Willow and Jaden Smith, Khalid, Karrueche, Will.i.am, Duckwrth, Ben Platt, Amanda Kloots, Sabrina Claudio, Dove Cameron, Caitlin Reilly, Gracie Abrams and Eric Andre.</p>"
