   "title": "PRODUCTION DETAILS",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>Due to the extremely high profile nature of the event mixed with the growing concern over the Delta wave of the COVID pandemic, production details for the VIP event were a shifting target. We eventually settled on building an offsite drive-thru testing facility for all guests on top of the Beverly Hills Hilton parking structure manned by nurses and staff in full costume. Despite the circumstances we made the most of it with the experience starting at first contact.</p>",
     "right": "<p>Once onsite, the release party featured elements unique to that evening including an Impossible Burger food truck designed to the event with tray pass bites, macaroons for all guests and an open bar provided by Dos Hombres. Unlike the fan experience, all guests were able to partake in all aspects of the Destination at their leisure.</p>"
