  {
   "title": "BILLIE EILISH FAN EXPERIENCE",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>A cohesive narrative guided guests from the moment they arrived for check-in at the Beverly Hills Hilton. Fans boarded open-air shuttles to the property, where our tour guides (dressed in custom designed and handmade boilersuit uniforms) led attendees through 4 core areas over 45 minutes. Fans had the opportunity to literally follow in Billie’s footsteps and experience the album exactly as she intended it – and as she demonstrated at the party the night before.</p>",
     "right": "<p>BAs were trained to be ‘in-world’ as staff of the estate, each hosting a section with talking points related to the album. Attendees were able to ask questions to have a fuller sense of immersion and discover areas creatively directed by Billie herself.</p>"
