  {
   "title": "DETAILS OF THE DESTINATION",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p><strong>Spotify Enhanced Albums</strong>, a first for the brand, were brought to life through dedicated areas within the experience: Billie’s Suite, represented in-app <strong>Billie Mode</strong> (ex: a vanity with personal polaroids; custom content on vintage TV screens), the Fountain to represent <strong>Lyric Mode</strong> (ex: vinyl art lyrics and a custom pool menu), and the Garden Bar to represent <strong>Fan Mode</strong> (ex: fan wishes to Billie hung on a tree).</p>",
     "right": "<p>Each area had design details that related to every song on the new album for attendees to find. Provided a brochure upon entry, guests had a blast exploring the serene landscape while getting an early listen to the record. Those lucky enough to be there on the final day were even treated to sky writing in the air saying “Happier Than Ever”!</p>"
    },
